      "created_at": "2022-10-06T00:44:50.708Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi there,</p>\n<p>I’m (probably) going to be writing a short story inspired by <em><strong>Spirit Island</strong></em> some time in the near(ish) future. It will likely be about a small group of Invaders being menaced by some Spirits — simple enough stuff.</p>\n<p>But I’m having some trouble deciding which Spirit(s) to feature. So, I’ve journeyed here to ask for counsel on that: what Spirit should I feature?</p>\n<p>(I’m leaning towards focusing on only one Spirit, as that will make it simpler.)</p>\n<p>If I do end up writing this thing, I likely post it to this forum.</p>",
