      "cooked": "<p>SI fanfic? Breaking new ground!</p>\n<p>If you want menace, you can’t do much worse than Bringer of Dreams. Thunderspeaker might also work in that role, and you could go with the “we keep seeing this strange person in the raiding groups who seems to glow/vanish/always know where we are” angle, too.</p>",
