    {
      "id": 248562,
      "name": "",
      "username": "fjur",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-10-07T15:54:55.565Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t know the game</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I do heartily recommend it. You can get <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/spirit-island/id1501321205\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the app</a> for free.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m told it’s literally the Nexus of the Void</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>More or less, yes. The main differences are that Spirit Island has native islanders called the Dahan and doesn’t have the shifting biomes. Well, and it’s not a gateway to the Void.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I vote for whoever is the closest equivalent to Magma’s Rage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That would be Volcano Looming High:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf9783bb40e4be7a60672e0ba1c6654fbc09b7c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/dcf9783bb40e4be7a60672e0ba1c6654fbc09b7c\" title=\"Volcano Looming High Art\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf9783bb40e4be7a60672e0ba1c6654fbc09b7c.jpeg\" alt=\"Volcano Looming High Art\" data-base62-sha1=\"vwPwQtZEGTY5k2lz720sUKQbvfS\" width=\"450\" height=\"291\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Volcano Looming High Art</span><span class=\"informations\">600×388 67.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"29666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>SI fanfic?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, I suppose that that is what this is.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"29666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Breaking new ground!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thanks. It is unusual that no one has made any before, although I can see why.</p>\n<p>I’ll definitely consider your suggestions, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/takewalker\">@TakeWalker</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/the_justifier\">@The_Justifier</a>.</p>",
