      "raw": "[quote=\"The_Justifier, post:2, topic:29666\"]\nI don’t know the game\n[/quote]\nI do heartily recommend it. You can get [the app](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/spirit-island/id1501321205) for free.\n\n[quote=\"The_Justifier, post:2, topic:29666\"]\nI’m told it’s literally the Nexus of the Void\n[/quote]\nMore or less, yes. The main differences are that Spirit Island has native islanders called the Dahan and doesn’t have the shifting biomes. Well, and it’s not a gateway to the Void.\n\n[quote=\"The_Justifier, post:2, topic:29666\"]\nI vote for whoever is the closest equivalent to Magma’s Rage.\n[/quote]\nThat would be Volcano Looming High:\n![Volcano Looming High Art|600x388, 75%](upload://vwPwQtZEGTY5k2lz720sUKQbvfS.jpeg)\n\n[quote=\"TakeWalker, post:3, topic:29666\"]\nSI fanfic?\n[/quote]\nYes, I suppose that that is what this is.\n\n[quote=\"TakeWalker, post:3, topic:29666\"]\nBreaking new ground!\n[/quote]\nThanks. It is unusual that no one has made any before, although I can see why.\n\nI’ll definitely consider your suggestions, @TakeWalker and @The_Justifier.",
