      "created_at": "2022-10-08T01:39:21.461Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There’s definitely a couple out there, but it’s always good to see more! My only suggestion would be to focus on a spirit whose vibe you find interesting - I did Shadows Flicker, because I could see them acting like a horror movie monster and that was the sort of thing I felt like writing <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-10-08T01:39:21.461Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
